EB Garamond (Regular, Italic, Medium, Medium Italic) and Inter (Regular, Italic, Medium, SemiBold),
both under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, the typefaces of the Super Génial website.
Used to render invoice PDFs with full UTF-8 support (Prawn needs static TrueType files).
https://github.com/octaviopardo/EBGaramond12
https://github.com/rsms/inter
